"RC input is configured by default via the USART6 RX input. It supports all "
"serial RC protocols except PPM."
msgstr "RC 输入默认通过 USART6 RX 配置。支持除 PPM 以外的所有串行 RC 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:61
#: 33df8f654d8340e3b54d9355aeaa837e 469cf7ee5fec472ba878fdef305f6754
